    {
      "subId": "4006809",
      "subQuestName": "Approach the giant flower",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "400680901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "400680901": {
            "id": "400680901",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Wow, that flower is huuuge!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400680902"
            ]
          },
          "400680902": {
            "id": "400680902",
            "speakerId": 10095,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "It's so hot here... is it because of that flower?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400680903"
            ]
          },
          "400680903": {
            "id": "400680903",
            "speakerId": 12616,
            "speakerName": "Blazing Heart",
            "text": "Heck yeah, I wasn't expecting visitors.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400680904"
            ]
          },
          "400680904": {
            "id": "400680904",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Aaaah!!! It talks!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400680907"
            ]
          },
          "400680907": {
            "id": "400680907",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Paimon knows! But this is different!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400680908"
            ]
          },
          "400680908": {
            "id": "400680908",
            "speakerId": 1042,
            "speakerName": "Xinyan",
            "text": "Hi, we touched those drum-like plants growing on the beach outside, and were transported here. Are you the owner of this place?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400680909"
            ]
          },
          "400680909": {
            "id": "400680909",
            "speakerId": 12616,
            "speakerName": "Blazing Heart",
            "text": "This is the hall of music, and I'm merely its gatekeeper. Tell me, my friends, are you here to pursue the ultimate expression of music?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400680910"
            ]
          },
          "400680910": {
            "id": "400680910",
            "speakerId": 1042,
            "speakerName": "Xinyan",
            "text": "Ohh, you betcha!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400680911"
            ]
          },
          "400680911": {
            "id": "400680911",
            "speakerId": 12616,
            "speakerName": "Blazing Heart",
            "text": "Then tell me, what do you hope to express with music?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400680912"
            ]
          },
          "400680912": {
            "id": "400680912",
            "speakerId": 1042,
            "speakerName": "Xinyan",
            "text": "The spirit of resistance!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400680913"
            ]
          },
          "400680913": {
            "id": "400680913",
            "speakerId": 12616,
            "speakerName": "Blazing Heart",
            "text": "Right on, great answer! I'm so glad to hear that. I consider myself very lucky to meet another musician with the same ideals.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400680914"
            ]
          },
          "400680914": {
            "id": "400680914",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Even giant flowers get along well with Xinyan...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400680915"
            ]
          },
          "400680915": {
            "id": "400680915",
            "speakerId": 10095,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "People who are easy to get along with make friends wherever they go.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400680916"
            ]
          },
          "400680916": {
            "id": "400680916",
            "speakerId": 12616,
            "speakerName": "Blazing Heart",
            "text": "If you've made it this far, you must wish to venture deeper into the hall of music. However, I must apologize. My singing voice is required for entry, but unfortunately my pipes are a little dry...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400680917"
            ]
          },
          "400680917": {
            "id": "400680917",
            "speakerId": 1042,
            "speakerName": "Xinyan",
            "text": "Are you alright? Do you need... uh, some cold medicine or something?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400680918"
            ]
          },
          "400680918": {
            "id": "400680918",
            "speakerId": 12616,
            "speakerName": "Blazing Heart",
            "text": "It's just that I haven't had any Glacial Spring Water in a very long time. If I could drink some of that, my voice would be rocked and loaded, and ready to clear your path.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400680919"
            ]
          },
          "400680919": {
            "id": "400680919",
            "speakerId": 1042,
            "speakerName": "Xinyan",
            "text": "Glacial Spring Water?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400680920"
            ]
          },
          "400680920": {
            "id": "400680920",
            "speakerId": 12616,
            "speakerName": "Blazing Heart",
            "text": "Yeah. With one sip of that, anyone could sing the most beautiful song, no matter if they were a weary adult, a sleepy bird, or even an ignorant child...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400680921"
            ]
          },
          "400680921": {
            "id": "400680921",
            "speakerId": 1042,
            "speakerName": "Xinyan",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400680922"
            ]
          },
          "400680922": {
            "id": "400680922",
            "speakerId": 1042,
            "speakerName": "Xinyan",
            "text": "Okay, I'll find some for ya. Where is this spring?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400680923"
            ]
          },
          "400680923": {
            "id": "400680923",
            "speakerId": 12616,
            "speakerName": "Blazing Heart",
            "text": "Thanks, you're the best! Well, spring water helps plants grow up strong so that they can scale the mountains that lie in their way... so, I imagine the spring can be found somewhere on the mountain range protected by plants.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400680924"
            ]
          },
          "400680924": {
            "id": "400680924",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "You mean we have to go hiking? Oh, Paimon thought some seawater would be enough.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400680925"
            ]
          },
          "400680925": {
            "id": "400680925",
            "speakerId": 10095,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "Spring water and seawater could not be more dissimilar.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400680926"
            ]
          },
          "400680926": {
            "id": "400680926",
            "speakerId": 12616,
            "speakerName": "Blazing Heart",
            "text": "Oh, but you may need my powers in order to see the spring. Give me your hand, friend, so that you can see through my eyes.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400680927"
            ]
          },
          "400680927": {
            "id": "400680927",
            "speakerId": 1042,
            "speakerName": "Xinyan",
            "text": "Thanks! You shook my hand — guess that makes this friendship official!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4006810",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to everyone",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "400681001"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "400681001": {
            "id": "400681001",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh, we're out!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400681002"
            ]
          },
          "400681002": {
            "id": "400681002",
            "speakerId": 1042,
            "speakerName": "Xinyan",
            "text": "It's much brighter here. I didn't mind that hot cave, though.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400681003"
            ]
          },
          "400681003": {
            "id": "400681003",
            "speakerId": 1032,
            "speakerName": "Kaedehara Kazuha",
            "text": "Glacial Spring Water can be found on one of the mountains around here. Let's all look for it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400681004"
            ]
          },
          "400681004": {
            "id": "400681004",
            "speakerId": 10095,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "Wait, how can there be light coming from below the ground here? Is this... a water vein?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400681005"
            ]
          },
          "400681005": {
            "id": "400681005",
            "speakerId": 1042,
            "speakerName": "Xinyan",
            "text": "According to that flower, the water vein is related to the plants, and the plants will lead us to that spring. So I guess we should follow the water veins."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4006811",
      "subQuestName": "Clear the water veins that flow through the mountains",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4006812",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to everyone",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "400681201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "400681201": {
            "id": "400681201",
            "speakerId": 1032,
            "speakerName": "Kaedehara Kazuha",
            "text": "Everyone, I found a note here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400681202"
            ]
          },
          "400681202": {
            "id": "400681202",
            "speakerId": 1032,
            "speakerName": "Kaedehara Kazuha",
            "text": "Oh, so that's how it is. What an interesting island.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400681203"
            ]
          },
          "400681203": {
            "id": "400681203",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Look at this style and signature... it's from Albedo! He's one of our friends from Mondstadt.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400681204"
            ]
          },
          "400681204": {
            "id": "400681204",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "He's an amazing alchemist who's visited this island before. He left this note here for future adventurers.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400681205"
            ]
          },
          "400681205": {
            "id": "400681205",
            "speakerId": 1032,
            "speakerName": "Kaedehara Kazuha",
            "text": "Oh? So it's him.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400681206"
            ]
          },
          "400681206": {
            "id": "400681206",
            "speakerId": 1042,
            "speakerName": "Xinyan",
            "text": "He's saying this whole island has been turned into an instrument!? Amazing...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400681207"
            ]
          },
          "400681207": {
            "id": "400681207",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "And the underground water veins play an important part too... Oh, maybe we need to clear all the water veins to \"play\" this island.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400681208"
            ]
          },
          "400681208": {
            "id": "400681208",
            "speakerId": 1042,
            "speakerName": "Xinyan",
            "text": "Clean your instrument before the performance! Makes a lot of sense."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4006817",
      "subQuestName": "Clear the water veins that flow through the mountains",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4006815",
      "subQuestName": "Obtain Glacial Spring Water",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "400681501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "400681501": {
            "id": "400681501",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "This should be the Glacial Spring Water we're looking for.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400681502"
            ]
          },
          "400681502": {
            "id": "400681502",
            "speakerId": 10095,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "So if you drink this, you can suddenly sing like an angel?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400681503"
            ]
          },
          "400681503": {
            "id": "400681503",
            "speakerId": 1032,
            "speakerName": "Kaedehara Kazuha",
            "text": "You should give it a try, if you're curious.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400681504"
            ]
          },
          "400681504": {
            "id": "400681504",
            "speakerId": 10095,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "No no no, I'm terrible at singing... it would be extremely embarrassing if it didn't work.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400681505"
            ]
          },
          "400681505": {
            "id": "400681505",
            "speakerId": 1042,
            "speakerName": "Xinyan",
            "text": "Haha, Mona, I actually think you've got a sweet voice that's well-suited for singing! If you're interested, I can teach you a few things about vocals once we get back to camp.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400681506"
            ]
          },
          "400681506": {
            "id": "400681506",
            "speakerId": 10095,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "Really? I—I'd love to, but you'd have to promise you won't laugh at me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400681507"
            ]
          },
          "400681507": {
            "id": "400681507",
            "speakerId": 1042,
            "speakerName": "Xinyan",
            "text": "Of course not! Everyone's gotta start somewhere, right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400681508"
            ]
          },
          "400681508": {
            "id": "400681508",
            "speakerId": 10095,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "R—Right... then maybe I can give it a try.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400681509"
            ]
          },
          "400681509": {
            "id": "400681509",
            "speakerId": 1042,
            "speakerName": "Xinyan",
            "text": "Great! But before that, we should deliver the spring water to that flower.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "400681510"
            ]
          },
          "400681510": {
            "id": "400681510",
            "speakerId": 1032,
            "speakerName": "Kaedehara Kazuha",
            "text": "Well, to re-enter the mirage, we just need to touch the drum on the beach again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
